' presentation
DashboardApp "1" *-- "8" Panel
Panel <|.. DashboardPanel
Panel <|.. TodayPanel
Panel <|.. PlanPanel
Panel <|.. AnalyticsPanel
Panel <|.. RecoveryPanel
Panel <|.. NutritionPanel
Panel <|.. CoachPanel
Panel <|.. ProfilePanel
Panel ..> SpotterEvent : names in changedBy >
DashboardApp *-- "1" GuiContext
DashboardApp ..> EventBus : subscribes panels >
DashboardApp ..|> EventListener
GuiContext *-- "1" CoachController
GuiContext *-- "1" EventBus
GuiContext *-- "1" FxTaskRunner
GuiContext --> SpotterConfig
GuiContext ..> LLMClient
Panel "*" --> "1" GuiContext
TodayPanel *-- "1" PlanEditHistory
