JsonOutput ..> AgentResult
JsonOutput ..> TrainingBlock

' application
CoachController --> CsvImportService
CoachController --> StrengthAnalytics
CoachController --> AttemptCalculator
CoachController --> RecoveryRuleEngine
CoachController --> Database
CoachController --> Repository
