ProgressionStrategyFactory --> ExperienceLevel
LifterProfile --> TrainingGoal
LifterProfile --> SplitPreference
LifterProfile --> ExperienceLevel
OnboardingAgent ..> ProfileDraft : produces
ProfileDraft ..> LifterProfile : converts to
ProgrammeParserAgent ..> TrainingBlock : produces
ProgrammeImportService ..> TrainingBlock : builds
ProgrammeImportService --> ExerciseCatalog
ProgrammeImportService ..> ColumnMapping
TrainingBlock --> BlockOrigin
